{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103680","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103680","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710368001:0":{"text":"……为什么会突然出现这么多魔物！科丝蒂，你还能撑住吗？","source_cn":"……为什么会突然出现这么多魔物！科丝蒂，你还能撑住吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5A80060D4172E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710368002:1":{"text":"……我还能坚持！绝对不能让它们伤害公主殿下和大家！","source_cn":"……我还能坚持！绝对不能让它们伤害公主殿下和大家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA68C11DB37C4EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710368003:1":{"text":"完了……全完了……艾雅在上，请女神保佑……","source_cn":"完了……全完了……艾雅在上，请女神保佑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB224E6AA7B3F7DE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710368004:1":{"text":"坦尼斯！现在祈祷有什么用？不如想点实际的办法！","source_cn":"坦尼斯！现在祈祷有什么用？不如想点实际的办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3565B19F8568520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710368005:1":{"text":"殿下，魔物源源不断，仅凭我和宫廷魔法师恐怕无法护住所有人。","source_cn":"殿下，魔物源源不断，仅凭我和宫廷魔法师恐怕无法护住所有人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B47C0A3258F973","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710368006:1":{"text":"请您带着大家继续往后撤离，我来断后！","source_cn":"请您带着大家继续往后撤离，我来断后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8EE032AD6E604E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710368007:1":{"text":"往后撤离？！后面的路被堵上了，哪有地方可去……！","source_cn":"往后撤离？！后面的路被堵上了，哪有地方可去……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFBAF3C664FFE288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710368008:1":{"text":"后面是死路！你们也撑不了多久的！","source_cn":"后面是死路！你们也撑不了多久的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x624CCAAAD3338F73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710368009:1":{"text":"……不，还有一个办法。一个能够瞬间逆转局势，保护所有人的办法……","source_cn":"……不，还有一个办法。一个能够瞬间逆转局势，保护所有人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78EF34E9DD5939A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710368010:1":{"text":"佩吉的目光落在了那把插在巨石之中的长剑上，而所有人顺着她的目光也意识到了什么……","source_cn":"佩吉的目光落在了那把插在巨石之中的长剑上，而所有人顺着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0499D5102D8958C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710368011:1":{"text":"公主殿下！您……您难道是想……？！","source_cn":"公主